eegfaktura-energystore-v2
=========================

Time-series storage and ingest service for the eegfaktura suite: a
re-implementation of the energystore component
(https://github.com/eegfaktura/eegfaktura-energystore) on TimescaleDB.

Part of the eegfaktura suite (https://github.com/eegfaktura), an open-source
billing and management platform for Austrian renewable energy communities
(Erneuerbare-Energiegemeinschaften, EEG), published by VFEEG - Verein zur
Förderung von Erneuerbaren Energiegemeinschaften.


